# Copy this file to setup.env (same directory), then set your machine's path.
#
# This is the ONLY place the toolchain path is written. The root CMakeLists.txt,
# C_src/compile.sh, C_src/flash.sh and C_src/Makefile all read this file, so the
# four build paths cannot drift apart.
#
# setup.env is gitignored (**/*.env), so each developer keeps their own without
# conflicts. Override for one command with the environment instead of editing:
#     RTEMS_LOCAL_PATH=/somewhere/else ./compile.sh
#
# The toolchain is expected at $RTEMS_LOCAL_PATH/RTEMS_toolchain/rtems

# ALBI
RTEMS_LOCAL_PATH=/Users/albertofurlan/Developer/PoliMi
